  "note": "Public-domain (vendor-neutral) citation; the span is the citation core only, so a pinpoint paragraph and a parallel reporter cite stay outside it. No URL template: no fetch-verified host decodes this form yet. Citations were assigned retroactively in 2013 back to volume 1, so the year is not bounded below."
